OL,3,AMurder arrests after fire kills two
OL,4,Aincluding child
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder after two people died in a
OL,8,Fhouse fire including a child, police
OL,9,Fhave confirmed.
OL,11,FThe blaze in Grangetown, near
OL,12,FMiddlesbrough, broke out just before
OL,13,F05:30 BST and also left a 48-year-old
OL,14,Fwoman in hospital in a critical
OL,15,Fcondition, alongside a further three
OL,16,Fpeople who suffered non-life
OL,17,Fthreatening injuries.
OL,19,FCleveland Police said the two victims
OL,20,Fwere yet to be formally identified.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
